# domain-objects (package)

model domain concepts as runtime-checked classes (ddd)
- `DomainLiteral<T>` — immutable value; identity = all properties (Address)
- `DomainEntity<T>` — mutable lifecycle; identity = `static unique = [...]` (+ `static primary`)
- `DomainEvent<T>` — signals
```ts
interface RocketShip { uuid?: string; serialNumber: string; fuelQuantity: number; homeAddress: Address }
class RocketShip extends DomainEntity<RocketShip> implements RocketShip {
  public static unique = ['serialNumber'] as const;
  public static nested = { homeAddress: Address };
}
```
features: `RefByPrimary` / `RefByUnique` / `Ref` (type-safe keys) · `static nested` (hydration) · schema validation (zod/yup/joi) · `.clone()`, `.build()`, `withImmute` · `getUniqueIdentifier`, `serialize`
docs: `rhx get.package.docs readme --of domain-objects`
